From 8a0ec566aaddd1d144772c54bdb22e6540f2ad7f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Adrian Gruntkowski <adrian.gruntkowski@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 2 Apr 2026 19:27:43 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add ability to skip site members and invitations during
 transfer (#6184)

* Add ability to skip site members and invitations during transfer

* Expose button to skip members during transfer if over team members limit

* Make options to plan limits check more consistent

* Fix a typo

* Extend tests for `Quota.ensure_with_plan_limits`

* Extend tests for `Invitations.Accept` service

* Merge two buttons into a dropdown

- Instead of displaying "Accept without members" and "Upgrade to accept" buttons, we now show it in an "Accept" dropdown with these options
- Hide notice icon on mobile

* Test invitation controller case when passing the parameter

* Apply formatting to notice component

* Extend invitation notice component tests

* Make some of the tests EE-only

* Fix a typo

Co-authored-by: Uku Taht <Uku.taht@gmail.com>

* Apply z-index to dropdown menu instead of the wrapping slot

---------

Co-authored-by: Sanne de Vries <sannedv@protonmail.com>
Co-authored-by: Uku Taht <Uku.taht@gmail.com>
